  "background": "",
  "content": "<p>I understand you think by not belonging.<br/>\nI mean <em>think in the wrong places and way</em>.<br/>\nAnd you don't discriminate against<br/>\n<aa to=\"7,145\">backpacks</aa> I imagine or the temperature<br/>\nof a floor? Or the floor at all.<br/>\nCan you send me the poetry you<br/>\nwrote before solving the rota conjecture?</p>\nRx",
